<div id="Sx1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Sx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I would like to sincerely thank my advisor, Prof. Carlo Vittorio Cannistraci, for suggesting the name <span id="Sx1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Basis Decomposition</span> and for encouraging me to present this work as a sole author.
I am also grateful to my colleague Yingtao for his valuable help and support during this work.</p>
</div>
</section>
